(text "CM4 with eMMC (not Lite): two Hirose 100-position sockets, 33.92mm centre spacing.\nPin mapping transcribed from the official CM4 IO Board native schematic. J2 pin 1 corresponds to CM4 pin 101.\nUnused interfaces have explicit no-connects. CM4 3.3V output supplies GPIO_VREF; internal BT is disabled." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9197b3c2-804b-492f-818f-675e9db91977))
